WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Recurring tasks. Repeat a task daily, on weekdays, weekly, monthly, yearly or on a custom rule.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: fortnightly 1:1s; plant care.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.000
You complete the task → The rule picks the next date → A new copy appears

4
00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:17.620
Under Repeat, choose a preset or Custom…

5
00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:19.380
…pick the weekdays…

6
00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:20.910
…and how often.

7
00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:23.780
Flow reads the rule back: every 2 weeks on Monday and Thursday.

8
00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:25.840
Complete it, and the next occurrence appears.

9
00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:29.670
Here it is, due Thursday.

10
00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:35.670
No next copy appeared: Only completing (Done) spawns the next one; canceling doesn't. The next date looks off by a day: Check the rule was set in the right time zone; edit and re-save it from this browser.

11
00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:40.170
Presets and custom rules
